Your program should take a Swift source file as input and output the count of each unique Swift declaration attribute kind found in the file.

For example, given the following Swift source file:
```swift
class MyClass {
    @discardableResult
    func myFunction() {
        // function body
    }

    @objc
    var myProperty: Int

    @available(iOS 10.0, *)
    func myAvailableFunction() {
        // function body
    }
